WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.419
The Gaussian propeller.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.429
Split a Gaussian cloud; sum each piece's squared

3
00:00:05.429 --> 00:00:07.729
